{"id": 31, "ts": 1781187124.955811, "event": "public_discussion_message", "round": 2, "agent": "sarah_mitchell", "message": "I appreciate the clarification from James that Candidate\u202fB has a relatively weak memory for numbers, confirming a gap in his attention\u2011to\u2011detail. In a long\u2011distance pilot role, precise handling of numeric data\u2014fuel calculations, altitude clearances, and timing\u2014is non\u2011negotiable. This shortfall compounds the earlier concerns about his uncooperative, pretentious demeanor and further weakens his overall safety profile. By contrast, Candidate\u202fC\u2019s 100\u202f% reliability, rapid correct decision\u2011making, and proven ability to foster a positive crew atmosphere directly address the core criteria of operational reliability, decision quality, and crew cooperation. While C\u2019s communication style and limited appetite for further education remain concerns, they do not outweigh the critical deficiency we now see in B\u2019s information\u2011accuracy capability. Therefore, I maintain my provisional recommendation for Candidate\u202fC as the stronger overall fit."}
